      "en": "Arrangements for automatically controlling steering depending on driving conditions sensed and responded to, e.g. control circuits (means for initiating a change in direction B62D1/00; steering valves B62D5/06; combined with means for inclining the vehicle body or wheels on bends B62D9/00)<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br> When classifying in this group, classification is also made in the appropriate one of groups B62D1/00&#160;-&#160;B62D5/00 or B62D7/00&#160;-&#160;B62D19/00 if other aspects of the steering system are of interest ",
